abstract: >-
  Supplementary materials package for the book chapter "Global Insights of the
  Urban Microbiome and AMR Landscape from Metagenomic Mapping" (Academic Press,
  Elsevier). It maps the urban microbiome and its antimicrobial-resistance (AMR)
  landscape in 8,053 public urban environmental shotgun metagenomes from 112
  datasets, 106 countries and 274 cities, analysed in three streams kept separate
  by pipeline (Indian open-drain wastewater with CARD/RGI; the global ResFinder
  resource; and uniform reprocessing of 51 runs centred on Dhaka and South Asian
  comparators). The package contains the Supplementary Material document,
  Tables S1-S96, Figures S1-S30, twelve cleaned datasets with data dictionaries,
  an independent recomputation of the headline results, analysis code and
  executed notebooks, and methodological and quality-control reports.
keywords:
  - Antimicrobial Resistance
  - AMR
  - Metagenomics
  - Supplementary Materials
  - Elsevier
